    "source": "image",
    "scale_note": "No printed dimensions or room areas, so I used the standard 0.85 m door as a last resort. The hall door chord is about 78 px in the 2000 px view, which gives about 90 px/m. The outer box then comes to roughly 9.0 x 5.9 m.",
    "notes": "Wall thickness was left at the default. Some windows in the upper-floor top, left and right walls were too faint to read, so I left them out. The right-wall windows on the ground floor are uncertain. The 0.55 m window on the right side of the ground-floor top wall is also uncertain. The stairs have no to_level offset or step count printed, so 14 steps is an estimate. Ground-floor kitchen and living room are open to each other through a gap, but I kept them as separate rooms."
